<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<!-- METADADOS DE SEO -->
<title>Ferramentas financeiras — Guia do Nome Limpo</title>
<meta name="description" content="Use calculadoras locais de desconto de dívidas, orçamento doméstico e parcelas pelo sistema Price.">

<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@500;600;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  /* ============ TOKENS ============ */
  :root{
    --navy-900:#0a1a30; --navy-800:#0f2745; --navy-700:#16345e;
    --blue-500:#2f6fed; --blue-400:#5b8fff; --gray-600:#5b6b82;
    --gray-300:#c4cedd; --gray-100:#eef1f6; --white:#ffffff;
    --clean-green:#1fae6f; --clean-green-soft:#e4f7ee; --dirty-red:#e35b5b;
    --font-display:'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; --font-body:'Inter', sans-serif; --font-mono:'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    --radius-sm:6px; --radius-md:10px; --radius-lg:18px; --max-w:1180px;
  }

  *{box-sizing:border-box; margin:0; padding:0;}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
  body{ font-family:var(--font-body); background:var(--gray-100); color:var(--navy-900); line-height:1.5; -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased; }
  img,svg{display:block; max-width:100%;}
  a{color:inherit; text-decoration:none;}
  ul{list-style:none;}
  button{font-family:inherit; cursor:pointer;}
  .wrap{max-width:var(--max-w); margin:0 auto; padding:0 24px;}
  .eyebrow{ font-family:var(--font-mono); font-size:.72rem; letter-spacing:.14em; text-transform:uppercase; font-weight:600; }

  /* ============ BUTTONS ============ */
  .btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 10px 20px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.9rem; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); transition: all 0.2s ease; border: 1px solid transparent; }
  .btn-primary { background: var(--blue-500); color: var(--white); }
  .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--blue-400); }

  /* ============ HEADER ============ */
  header.site { background: var(--white); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gray-300); position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 100; }
  .header-inner { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; height: 72px; gap: 24px; }
  .logo { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--navy-900); }
  .logo small { display: block; font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 400; color: var(--gray-600); }
  nav.primary ul { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 24px; }
  nav.primary a { font-weight: 500; font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--navy-900); transition: color 0.2s ease; }
  nav.primary a:hover { color: var(--blue-500); }

  /* Dropdown Styles */
  .has-dropdown { position: relative; }
  @media (min-width: 721px) { .has-dropdown::after { content: ''; position: absolute; bottom: -15px; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 15px; } }
  .dropdown-menu { position: absolute; top: 100%; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(15px); background: var(--white); border: 1px solid var(--gray-300); border-top: 3px solid var(--blue-500); border-radius: 0 0 var(--radius-sm) var(--radius-sm); box-shadow: 0 14px 30px rgba(10,26,48,0.12); min-width: 240px; padding: 8px 0; opacity: 0; visibility: hidden; transition: all 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0; z-index: 10; }
  @media (min-width: 721px) { .has-dropdown:hover .dropdown-menu { opacity: 1; visibility: visible; transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(4px); } }
  .dropdown-menu a { display: block; padding: 10px 20px; font-size: 0.88rem; font-weight: 500; color: var(--navy-800); transition: all 0.2s ease; }
  .dropdown-menu a:hover { background: var(--gray-100); color: var(--blue-500); padding-left: 26px; }

  /* ============ CATEGORY HERO ============ */
  .category-hero { background: var(--navy-900); color: var(--white); padding: 48px 0; border-bottom: 4px solid var(--blue-500); }
  .category-hero h1 { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 2.2rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .category-hero p { color: var(--gray-300); max-width: 60ch; font-size: 1.05rem; }

  /* ============ CONTENT LAYOUT ============ */
  .section { padding: 56px 0; }
  .content-layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 340px; gap: 40px; align-items: start; }
  
  /* Layout específico para ferramentas */
  .tools-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 24px; }

  /* Cards de Ferramentas */
  .tool-card { background: var(--white); border: 1px solid var(--gray-300); border-radius: var(--radius-md); padding: 32px 24px; text-align: center; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; transition: transform .18s ease, box-shadow .18s ease; }
  .tool-card:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); box-shadow: 0 14px 30px rgba(10,26,48,.09); border-color: var(--blue-400); }
  
  .tool-icon { width: 56px; height: 56px; background: var(--clean-green-soft); color: var(--clean-green); border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .tool-icon svg { width: 28px; height: 28px; }
  
  .tool-card h3 { font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.15rem; line-height: 1.3; color: var(--navy-900); margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .tool-card p { color: var(--gray-600); font-size: .9rem; line-height: 1.55; margin-bottom: 24px; flex: 1; }
  .tool-card .btn { width: 100%; }
  .tool-card.financial-tool { align-items: stretch; text-align: left; }
  .financial-tool .tool-icon { align-self: center; }
  .financial-tool h3 { text-align: center; }
  .financial-tool .tool-intro { margin: 0 0 18px; text-align: left; }
  .tool-form { width: 100%; display: grid; gap: 12px; }
  .tool-form label { display: block; margin-bottom: 5px; color: var(--navy-800); font-size: .82rem; font-weight: 600; }
  .tool-form input { width: 100%; min-width: 0; padding: 11px 12px; border: 1px solid var(--gray-300); border-radius: var(--radius-sm); background: var(--white); color: var(--navy-900); font: inherit; }
  .tool-form input[aria-invalid="true"] { border-color: #a32626; }
  .tool-help { margin: 0; color: var(--gray-600); font-size: .78rem; text-align: left; }
  .tool-error { margin: 0; color: #a32626; font-size: .84rem; font-weight: 600; text-align: left; }
  .tool-results { padding: 14px; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); background: var(--clean-green-soft); }
  .tool-results p { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; margin: 0 0 7px; color: var(--navy-800); font-size: .86rem; text-align: left; }
  .tool-results p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .tool-results output { color: var(--clean-green); font-family: var(--font-mono); font-weight: 700; text-align: right; }
  .tool-submit { width: 100%; padding: 12px 16px; border: 0; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); background: var(--navy-900); color: var(--white); font: 700 .9rem var(--font-body); cursor: pointer; }
  .tool-submit:hover { background: var(--blue-500); }
  .formula-note { margin-top: 16px; color: var(--gray-600); font-size: .82rem; text-align: left; }
  .formula-note summary { color: var(--blue-500); font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; }
  .formula-note p { margin: 8px 0 0; }

  /* Sidebar */
  .sidebar { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 24px; position: sticky; top: 92px; }
  .side-block { background: var(--white); border: 1px solid var(--gray-300); border-radius: var(--radius-md); padding: 22px; }
  .side-block h4 { font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 600; font-size: .98rem; margin-bottom: 14px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }

  /* FOOTER */
  footer.site { background: var(--navy-900); color: var(--gray-300); padding: 40px 0 20px; margin-top: 40px; }
  .footer-bottom { border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); padding-top: 20px; margin-top: 20px; font-size: 0.8rem; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; }

  @media (max-width: 980px){
    .content-layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .sidebar { position: static; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 720px){
    .tools-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .sidebar { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
{% include "partials/responsive-assets.njk" %}
</head>
<body>

  <!-- ============ HEADER ============ -->
  {% include "partials/navigation.njk" %}

  <!-- ============ CATEGORY HERO ============ -->
  <section class="category-hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="eyebrow" style="color: var(--blue-400); margin-bottom: 8px; display: block;">Kit de Ferramentas</span>
      <h1>Nossas Calculadoras</h1>
      <p>Faça estimativas no navegador. Os valores são ilustrativos e não são propostas de credores, orientação individual nem promessa de condições.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ MAIN CONTENT ============ -->
  <main id="main-content" tabindex="-1" class="wrap section">
    <div class="content-layout">

      <!-- LISTA DE FERRAMENTAS -->
      <div>
        <div class="tools-grid">

          <!-- FERRAMENTA 1: Desconto à vista -->
          <section class="tool-card financial-tool" aria-labelledby="discountTitle">
            <div class="tool-icon">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 3H4v18h16V3h-5M9 3v4h6V3M9 3a3 3 0 016 0"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 id="discountTitle">Calculadora de desconto de dívida</h3>
            <p class="tool-intro">Informe um valor de referência e o percentual de desconto para calcular a economia e o valor restante.</p>
            <form id="discountCalculator" class="tool-form" novalidate>
              <div><label for="calcDebt">Valor original da dívida (R$)</label><input id="calcDebt" name="debt" type="text" inputmode="decimal" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Ex.: 3.200,00" required aria-required="true" aria-describedby="discountHelp"></div>
              <div><label for="calcDiscount">Desconto (%)</label><input id="calcDiscount" name="discount" type="text" inputmode="decimal" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Ex.: 45" required aria-required="true" aria-describedby="discountHelp"></div>
              <p class="tool-help" id="discountHelp">Dívida maior que zero, até duas casas decimais e no máximo R$ 1 bilhão; desconto entre 0% e 100%.</p>
              <p class="tool-error" data-error role="alert" hidden></p>
              <div class="tool-results" data-results role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden>
                <p>Economia calculada <output data-output="savings"></output></p>
                <p>Valor após o desconto <output data-output="finalAmount"></output></p>
              </div>
              <button class="tool-submit" type="submit">Calcular desconto</button>
            </form>
            <details class="formula-note"><summary>Fórmula e limites</summary><p>Economia = dívida × desconto. Valor final = dívida − economia. É uma conta ilustrativa; ofertas reais podem ter outras condições.</p></details>
          </section>

          <!-- FERRAMENTA 2: Simulador de Parcelamento -->
          <section class="tool-card financial-tool" aria-labelledby="installmentTitle">
            <div class="tool-icon">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"/><line x1="16" y1="2" x2="16" y2="6"/><line x1="8" y1="2" x2="8" y2="6"/><line x1="3" y1="10" x2="21" y2="10"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 id="installmentTitle">Simulador de parcelamento</h3>
            <p class="tool-intro">Estime parcelas mensais com uma taxa efetiva mensal informada, usando parcelas constantes pelo sistema Price.</p>
            <form id="installmentCalculator" class="tool-form" novalidate>
              <div><label for="financedAmount">Valor financiado (R$)</label><input id="financedAmount" name="principal" type="text" inputmode="decimal" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Ex.: 1.000,00" required aria-required="true" aria-describedby="installmentHelp"></div>
              <div><label for="installmentPeriods">Quantidade de parcelas mensais</label><input id="installmentPeriods" name="periods" type="text" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Ex.: 12" required aria-required="true" aria-describedby="installmentHelp"></div>
              <div><label for="monthlyRate">Taxa efetiva mensal (%)</label><input id="monthlyRate" name="monthlyRate" type="text" inputmode="decimal" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Ex.: 1,00" required aria-required="true" aria-describedby="installmentHelp"></div>
              <p class="tool-help" id="installmentHelp">Valor maior que zero, até duas casas decimais e no máximo R$ 1 bilhão; 1 a 600 parcelas; taxa mensal entre 0% e 100%.</p>
              <p class="tool-error" data-error role="alert" hidden></p>
              <div class="tool-results" data-results role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden>
                <p>Parcela mensal <output data-output="monthlyInstallment"></output></p>
                <p>Total pago estimado <output data-output="totalPaid"></output></p>
                <p>Custo dos juros estimado <output data-output="interestCost"></output></p>
              </div>
              <button class="tool-submit" type="submit">Simular parcelas</button>
            </form>
            <details class="formula-note"><summary>Fórmula e limites</summary><p>Sistema Price: parcela = P × i ÷ (1 − (1 + i)<sup>−n</sup>), onde P é o valor financiado, i é a taxa efetiva por mês como fração e n é o número de parcelas mensais. Com taxa zero, parcela = P ÷ n. Informe a taxa na mesma periodicidade mensal; uma taxa anual precisa ser convertida para taxa efetiva mensal antes da simulação. A conta não inclui tarifas, impostos, seguros ou outros custos; não é proposta de crédito e não representa o CET.</p></details>
          </section>

          <!-- FERRAMENTA 3: Orçamento doméstico -->
          <section class="tool-card financial-tool" aria-labelledby="budgetTitle">
            <div class="tool-icon">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21.21 15.89A10 10 0 1 1 8 2.83"/><path d="M22 12A10 10 0 0 0 12 2v10z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 id="budgetTitle">Simulador de orçamento doméstico</h3>
            <p class="tool-intro">Some renda e despesas mensais para ver o saldo aritmético depois dos compromissos informados.</p>
            <form id="budgetCalculator" class="tool-form" novalidate>
              <div><label for="netIncome">Renda líquida mensal (R$)</label><input id="netIncome" name="income" type="text" inputmode="decimal" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Ex.: 5.000,00" required aria-required="true" aria-describedby="budgetHelp"></div>
              <div><label for="essentialExpenses">Despesas essenciais (R$)</label><input id="essentialExpenses" name="essentials" type="text" inputmode="decimal" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Ex.: 2.200,00" required aria-required="true" aria-describedby="budgetHelp"></div>
              <div><label for="variableExpenses">Despesas variáveis (R$)</label><input id="variableExpenses" name="variable" type="text" inputmode="decimal" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Ex.: 700,00" required aria-required="true" aria-describedby="budgetHelp"></div>
              <div><label for="financialCommitments">Compromissos financeiros existentes (R$)</label><input id="financialCommitments" name="commitments" type="text" inputmode="decimal" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Ex.: 900,00" required aria-required="true" aria-describedby="budgetHelp"></div>
              <p class="tool-help" id="budgetHelp">Campos obrigatórios, zero ou maior, até duas casas decimais e R$ 1 bilhão por campo.</p>
              <p class="tool-error" data-error role="alert" hidden></p>
              <div class="tool-results" data-results role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden>
                <p>Saldo mensal calculado <output data-output="availableBalance"></output></p>
              </div>
              <button class="tool-submit" type="submit">Calcular saldo mensal</button>
            </form>
            <details class="formula-note"><summary>Fórmula e limites</summary><p>Saldo = renda líquida − despesas essenciais − despesas variáveis − compromissos informados. O saldo é uma conta, não uma recomendação nem o valor que necessariamente pode ser comprometido. Considere gastos irregulares, necessidades e imprevistos; não usamos percentual universal de renda.</p></details>
          </section>

        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- SIDEBAR -->
      <aside class="sidebar">
        
        <div class="side-block" style="background: var(--navy-900); color: #fff;">
          <h4 style="color: #fff;">Canais da Serasa</h4>
          <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--gray-300); margin-bottom: 16px;">Consulte informações e serviços nos canais oficiais da Serasa.</p>
          <a href="https://www.serasa.com.br" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-primary" style="width: 100%; background: var(--clean-green);">Acessar site da Serasa</a>
        </div>

        <div class="side-block">
          <div style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.65rem; color: var(--gray-600); text-align: right; margin-bottom: 6px; border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--gray-300); padding-bottom: 4px; letter-spacing: 0.1em;">
            PUBLICIDADE
          </div>
          <div style="width: 100%; height: 250px; background: var(--gray-100); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: var(--gray-600); font-size: 0.8rem;">
            Espaço reservado para publicidade
          </div>
        </div>

      </aside>

    </div>
  </main>

  <!-- ============ FOOTER ============ -->
  <footer class="site">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="footer-bottom">
        <span>© 2026 Guia do Nome Limpo. Todos os direitos reservados.</span>
        <div>
          <a href="index.html">Página Inicial</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>

<script src="/assets/financial-tools.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
